sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as Auth service
    U->>W: Submit email and password
    W->>A: POST /login
    alt valid
        A-->>W: 200 + token
        W-->>U: Go to dashboard
    else wrong password
        A-->>W: 401
        W-->>U: Show error
    end
    Note over W,A: Token expires in 1 hour
